   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "mlandslide_patchDetection_pipeline
   "source": [
    "# Landslide Candidate Patch Detection & GIS Export\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates the pipeline for detecting potential landslide candidate patches from InSAR-derived displacement data (`displacement.tif`) and topographic elevation (`dem.tif`).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Pipeline Features:\n",
    "1. **Dual Motion Detection**: Detects both **Downslope Motion** (subsidence / range lengthening < -x mm) and **Toe Uplift** (range shortening > +x mm).\n",
    "2. **User-Controlled Thresholds**: x = 5.0 mm displacement cutoff and y = 50.0 m² minimum patch area filter.\n",
    "3. **GIS Outputs**: Exports directly importable vector datasets (`candidate_patches.gpkg` and `candidate_patches.geojson`)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import geopandas as gpd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import tifffile\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "from landslide_pipeline import extract_landslide_patches\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Run Landslide Patch Extraction"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[INFO] Effective Threshold Applied: ±5.00 mm\n",
      "[INFO] Identified 88 raw candidate clusters for Downslope\n",
      "[INFO] Identified 101 raw candidate clusters for Toe_Uplift\n",
      "[SUCCESS] Exported 195 Candidate Patches:\n",
      "  -> QGIS GeoPackage: d:\\Microsoft_Data_Collection\\candidate_patches.gpkg\n",
      "  -> QGIS GeoJSON:    d:\\Microsoft_Data_Collection\\candidate_patches.geojson\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Execute extraction with user parameters: x = 5.0 mm, y = 50.0 m^2\n",
    "gdf = extract_landslide_patches(\n",
    "    disp_path=\"displacement.tif\",\n",
    "    dem_path=\"dem.tif\",\n",
    "    x_thresh_mm=5.0,\n",
    "    min_area_m2=50.0,\n",
    "    output_gpkg=\"candidate_patches.gpkg\",\n",
    "    output_geojson=\"candidate_patches.geojson\"\n",
    ")\n"
   ]
  },
